---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service | Bible Bedtime';
const description = 'Terms governing the Bible Bedtimes iPhone app, website, subscriptions, and official social content.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header />
  <main class="bg-cream">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16 lg:py-20">
      <h1 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-navy/60 text-sm mt-2">Last updated: July 31, 2026</p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-navy/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        These terms apply when you use the Bible Bedtimes iPhone app, biblebedtime.uk, or Bible Bedtime content on our official channels. Apple’s standard End User License Agreement also applies to the iPhone app.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">Personal Use</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        Bible Bedtimes grants you a limited, personal, non-commercial right to use the app and view or listen to its content. You may not copy, redistribute, sell, reverse engineer, or falsely present Bible Bedtime content as your own, except where applicable law expressly allows it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">Free and Premium Content</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        The app includes tonight’s complete Scripture passage and teaching, three complete stories, and samples of Premium stories without a subscription. Premium unlocks additional stories, videos, offline downloads, all-night listening, and the teaching archive, prayers, and closing lines. Available content may change as the library is updated.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">Subscriptions</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        Premium Monthly and Premium Yearly are auto-renewable subscriptions sold through Apple. The App Store purchase sheet shows the current local price, billing period, introductory-offer eligibility, and renewal terms before you confirm. Payment is charged to your Apple Account. Unless cancelled, the subscription renews automatically under Apple’s displayed terms.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        You can manage or cancel Premium in your Apple Account subscription settings. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current paid period. Refund requests are handled by Apple under Apple’s policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">Content and Service Availability</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        Bible Bedtimes uses remote content services, so an internet connection may be required for new or non-downloaded material. We may add, update, or remove content and may suspend a feature for maintenance, safety, legal, or operational reasons. We do not promise uninterrupted availability.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">Family Use</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        Parents and guardians are responsible for deciding whether content is appropriate for a child and for supervising purchases and device settings. Bible Bedtimes does not provide public posting, messaging, or account features inside the app.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">No Professional Advice</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        Bible Bedtimes is devotional and reflective content. It is not medical, legal, financial, mental-health, or other professional advice, and it is not an emergency service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">External Services</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        Apple handles app distribution, purchases, and subscriptions. Social platforms and linked websites operate under their own terms. Bible Bedtime publishes only to its official profiles and does not offer third-party account management to app users.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-navy text-2xl mt-10">Changes and Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        We may update these terms when the product or applicable requirements change. The updated date will appear above. For questions, contact Bible Bedtime through the official TikTok profile:
        <a class="text-navy underline hover:text-gold-deep" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@biblebedtimestories22">@biblebedtimestories22</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
